## 7. Environment matrix

| Variable | Purpose |
| -------- | ------- |
| `PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN` | Platform apex (`localhost`, `example.com`) |
| `TENANT_ROOT_DOMAIN` | Alias for public ingress parse (defaults to platform root) |
| `MARKETING_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | Override marketing origin (custom domain prod) |
| `PORTAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | Override portal origin for CTA + redirects |
| `TENANT_HOST_RESERVED_LABELS` | Reserved subdomain labels (`api`, `www`, …) |
| `PLATFORM_DOMAIN_VERIFY_STUB` | Dev: skip live DNS verify |

---

## 8. Platform mother (not a club)

| Host | App | Outcome |
| ---- | --- | ------- |
| `{root}` / `www.{root}` | `apps/marketing` mother shell | platform marketing |
| `admin.{root}` | Platform Control Center | `platform_admin` |

Club hosts must **never** resolve platform mother tenant.

